# Build output of release.py. These are the release assets, and the assets are
# the one thing this repository deliberately does not track — a git repository
# that stores binaries grows forever, which is the reason the DMGs live on the
# Releases page and not here. Rebuild rather than keep: the packing is
# deterministic, so `python3 release.py build <component>` reproduces any
# published archive byte for byte from the tree it was cut from.
dist/

.DS_Store
__pycache__/
